10	/**
11	 * Assigns a new owner's {@code customerCode} before it is saved. The code is
12	 * {@code <REGION>-<HASH8>} (see {@link OwnerCustomerCodes}): the region derived from the owner's
13	 * postcode and a hash of their telephone and last name, so it is a stable function of the owner's
14	 * own identity rather than a per-city sequence. When that code collides with an existing owner's,
15	 * it is de-duplicated by appending {@code -<n>} (smallest {@code n} of 2 or more that is unique).
16	 */
